{"type":"uit-contribution","plugin":"AudibleCharacterStatus","kinds":["free"],"entries":[{"Original":"Allows the sound from this plugin to play when the game is in the background.","Translated":"允许在游戏处于后台时播放此插件的声音。","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Enable Sound Outside of Combat","Translated":"在战斗之外启用声音","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Enable to make sounds play even while not in combat.","Translated":"即使不在战斗中也能发出声音。","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Save","Translated":"保存","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Low HP","Translated":"低生命值","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.LowHpSettings","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TreeNode"},{"Original":"Plays a sound when HP is low, based on the set percentage.","Translated":"根据设定的百分比，在生命值较低时播放声音。","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.LowHpSettings","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Sound File Path","Translated":"音效檔","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.LowHpSettings","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Percent To Trigger Low HP","Translated":"触发低血量的百分比","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.LowHpSettings","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"Sets the timer for when the sound will play again. (In Seconds)\nEx: 0.4 will play the sound every 0.4 seconds.\nSet to -100 for no looping","Translated":"设置声音再次播放的时间计时器。（以秒为单位）\n例如： 0.4将每0.4秒播放一次声音。\n设置为-100表示无循环","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.LowHpSettings","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Low MP","Translated":"低MP","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.LowMpSettings","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TreeNode"},{"Original":"Plays a sound when MP is low, based on the set percentage.","Translated":"根据设置的百分比，在MP较低时播放声音。","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.LowMpSettings","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Percent To Trigger Low MP","Translated":"触发低MP的百分比","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.LowMpSettings","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"File not found.","Translated":"文件无法找到.","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.FindSoundMessage","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextColored"},{"Original":"File is not supported. Use MP3, WAV, or OGG.","Translated":"文件不受支持。使用MP3、WAV或OGG。","Context":"PluginConfiguriation.FindSoundMessage","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextColored"}],"resources":[],"attributes":[]}